<p class="lede">What you can borrow, for how long, and how to keep it longer.</p>

<h2>Borrowing limits</h2>
<p>Members may hold twelve items at once. Audiobooks and DVDs count towards the same total.</p>

<h2 id="sec-renewals">Renewals</h2>
<p>An item may be renewed twice, either online or by telephone, as long as no other member has
  reserved it. A renewal runs for three weeks from the day it is made, not from the original due
  date.</p>

<h2>Reservations</h2>
<p>Reserved items are held at your chosen branch for seven days. We send a notice when an item is
  ready to collect.</p>
